# No end-of-line conversion, whatever core.autocrlf says (Git for Windows
# sets it): every checkout has the bytes of the repository, so the vendored
# sources stay byte for byte as scripts/update-clib.sh copied them and match
# the digest in clib_digest.h, and the fixture pages, the fuzz corpus and the
# files the tests read are the same on every system.
* -text
